Backport of upstream idg commit 343e78cd (AST-600, Dec 2021) "Support Stokes I only option in idg-api"
onto the llu/hip-rocm branch (abc8a7c3). wsclean >= 3.1 passes stokes_I_only=true for -pol I and hands
over single-polarisation images; without this the old idg-api writes 4-polarisation data into them
(segfault in BufferSetImpl::get_image). Tests excluded; they are not built by spack.

